WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.139
Even though Canva is an online software,
you can still create print graphics with it,

00:00:05.139 --> 00:00:10.300
and that means being able to create CMYK
files that you can send to a printer.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.300
Now, this will require Canva Pro, which
there's a link for it down in the description.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.958
However, let me show you here. First,
when you're working with colors,

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:23.226
you can select objects or maybe you're
working with shapes or anything like that,

00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:26.575
and you're going to have document
colors. In your document colors,

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:30.838
if you add a new color, you'll notice
it doesn't come with any sliders,

00:00:30.838 --> 00:00:33.149
but it does come
with the hex code.

00:00:33.149 --> 00:00:38.060
So any CMYK color you want to use,
take note of the hex code and input it

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:43.248
here to use that color in your document.
But to get a CMYK file out of this,

00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:46.300
like a PDF, we need
to go up to share.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:53.162
So in this resume example here, I'm just
going to go up to share, down to download,

00:00:53.162 --> 00:00:57.300
and then we're going to select
by file type PDF for print.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:04.050
Now, you have some options here like being able
to flatten it, et cetera, but under color profile,

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:09.300
we have RGB and then CMYK. So if you're
sending it to a printer, CMYK is best.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:14.300
It is a Canva Pro feature, so you'll
need Canva Pro to be able to do this.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:19.157
But you can click on CMYK and save your
download settings if you do this a lot,

00:01:19.157 --> 00:01:23.996
and then simply download. And it's going to allow you to
save that somewhere, or it's just going to download and

00:01:23.996 --> 00:01:30.300
then allow you to save it. But that's how
you can create CMYK designs here in Canva.

